                     (kg*m^2, within export rounding). Exact inertia alignment requires
                     correcting the training asset and checking PhysX runtime inertia. -->
                <inertial pos="0.057026 1.4351e-05 -0.020402" quat="0.538527 0.735051 -0.409955 0.0403199" mass="0.637" diaginertia="0.287075 0.286157 0.00176802"/>
